{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a beautiful town while discovering and collecting magical spirits along the way who will help you grow the town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Mode</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build &amp; Expand</strong> - Gather food, wood, and resources to grow your town.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Villager Care</strong> - Keep everyone fed by gathering enough food, assigning jobs, and balancing happiness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress &amp; Unlocks</strong> - Level up, unlock new territories, buildings, and upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spirits</strong> - Unlock spirits through playful world interactions (cook a chicken to summon Peppok, destroy a bush, or even make a villager fly!). Spirits lend their magic to help manage your growing town.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage Spirits</strong> - Assign spirits to mine shards to buy unique spirit buildings and in order to unlock further territories.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Mode</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlimited Building</strong> - Design freely without limits. Build, decorate, and shape your dream magical town at your own pace.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo Content</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo, you can play <strong>Survival Mode up to Level 4</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the charm of building, managing, and unlocking spirits, then continue your journey in the full release, where progression goes further, new upgrades await, and a new Spirit Temple will emerge in distant territories, awaiting restoration through the spirits you gather.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Tutorial Comple